## No context-size gate for router downgrades

Cheap-class subagent/router downgrades use `config.SmallModelFor(provider)` within
the same provider (e.g. DeepSeek pro → flash, Z.AI glm-5.3 → glm-4.7, Moonshot
kimi-k3 → kimi-k2.7-code). Small models have large context; there is no
performance-based skip based on context size.

